      "content": "talking to people just makes it worse. they either look at me with pity or they look at me like i'm some kind of criminal. it's like the person i was is already dead. i'm just a shell. how am i supposed to just \"navigate\" through this when there's nothing to navigate back to? there's no version of my life where this gets fixed.",
